  "scope_boundary": "This controlled experiment tests when a shared somatic teaching coordinate ceases to be sufficient as simultaneously active branches require incompatible updates, including the predicted dependence of that boundary on branch number. It does not show that ordinary Fashion-MNIST requires dendritic routing, that biological dendrites use the imposed gate, or that dendritic material is the only implementation of path-resolved credit."
